1
00:00:04,938 --> 00:00:06,845
麦克
Mike.

2
00:00:09,142 --> 00:00:10,131
Mike.

3
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:12,860
麦克，我在打电话
Mike, I'm trying to talk on the phone.

4
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,800
对不起，我没注意到
Right. I didn't even notice, Carol. Sorry.

5
00:00:18,218 --> 00:00:19,207
太棒了
Neat!

6
00:00:19,986 --> 00:00:22,030
麦克!
Michael!

7
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:33,120
孩子们
Hi, guys.

8
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,860
爸爸，下午好
Good afternoon, Father.

9
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,900
今天发零用钱
Oh, it's allowance day.

10
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:42,560
是吗？
- It is? - Oh?

11
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:44,080
我都忘了
What do you know?

12
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:48,000
你们装得挺像的
You kids really think you can con me.

13
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:50,160
爸爸，我在清洁，没听到你说什么
I'm sorry, Father, I couldn't hear you. I was dusting.

14
00:00:51,051 --> 00:00:53,260
好吧，给你们血汗钱
Please. Okay. Here's your blood money.

15
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:54,080
好的
All right.

16
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:57,340
这不代表你们骗得过我了
Just don't think for a minute I bought into your act...

17
00:00:58,480 --> 00:01:01,180
不过谢谢你们这样大费周章
and thanks for going to the trouble of trying to deceive me.

18
00:01:01,461 --> 00:01:03,973
随时乐意
Anytime.

19
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:06,270
另外，我也不介意.
And it warms my heart...

20
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,500
在妈妈回来以前.
to know that this room will be clean...

21
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:11,240
你们能把这里打扫干净，叠好衣服
and the laundry neatly folded by the time your mom gets home.

22
00:01:15,580 --> 00:01:18,280
爸，你给多了
Hey, Dad, you gave me too much...

23
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:22,500
我也是，双倍
Me, too. He gave me double.

24
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:26,840
我也是，这不妥
Yeah, me, too. Hey, I don't like this.

25
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:30,240
事有蹊跷
Something smells rotten.

26
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:32,420
是本
It's Ben.

27
00:01:34,940 --> 00:01:37,960
现在是二月份，忘了吗？
No, it's February. Remember?

28
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:44,780
爸爸的生日骗局
Yeah, it's Dad's annual birthday scam.

29
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:48,180
老头要让我们把零用钱都买礼物
The old man thinks he's going to con us into spending all this on him.

30
00:01:49,540 --> 00:01:50,620
真可怜
Poor guy.

31
00:01:52,860 --> 00:01:56,680
-凯罗，你买什么礼物？ -我不说
- So, Carol, what are you going to get him? - I'm not telling.

32
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:59,540
又送汗衫，一如往年？
What, another preppy shirt like you get him every year?

33
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:02,880
我能怎么超越你呢？
How, oh, how, will I ever top that?

34
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:05,700
我要送他最好的礼物
Well, I've got the perfect present.

35
00:02:06,426 --> 00:02:07,300
是什么？
What?

36
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:10,980
我在学校做的烟灰缸
I'm giving Dad the ashtray I created in school.

37
00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:16,260
他不抽烟，你想得真周到
Great present for a guy who doesn't smoke.

38
00:02:17,780 --> 00:02:20,240
那你送他什么礼物？
Yeah, well, what are you going to get him?

39
00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:22,580
-准备好了吗？ -好
- All right, you guys ready for this? - Sure.

40
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:27,680
-送一本书 -爸爸有很多书了
- A book. - Dad already has a book.

41
00:02:29,620 --> 00:02:31,340
天哪，那倒是
Oh, my God, that's right.

42
00:02:33,201 --> 00:02:36,934
(English Subtitle) Growing.Pains.S01E17 -= Charity.Begins.at.Home =- Subripped by zerox

43
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:37,480
★祝我生日快乐，祝我生日快乐
I wish me a happy birthday I wish me a happy birthday

44
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:39,820
★祝我生日快乐
I wish me a happy birthday

45
00:03:40,987 --> 00:03:43,525
★因为我是好样的
'Cause I'm such a cool guy

46
00:03:45,825 --> 00:03:47,940
-亲爱的 -亲爱的
- Hi, sweetheart. - Hi, honey.

47
00:03:47,940 --> 00:03:48,960
今天好吗？
How was your day?

48
00:03:49,529 --> 00:03:52,580
妙手回春的心理医师.
My day. Listen, the old miracle-worker here had a major breakthrough...

49
00:03:52,580 --> 00:03:54,940
在一个治疗两年的病人上有了突破
with a patient I've been treating for two years now.

50
00:03:55,768 --> 00:03:58,410
吸尘器的声音？
Is that the vacuum cleaner?

51
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,120
对，孩子们在打扫
Yeah. Yeah, the kids are cleaning.

52
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:03,300
-病人已经.. -全部都在？
- So, anyway, this patient... - All of them?

53
00:04:03,780 --> 00:04:06,940
对，让我说说那个.
Yeah. So let me tell you about this guy.

54
00:04:07,260 --> 00:04:10,580
恐惧自己体液的病人.
Now, he was terrified of his own bodily fluids...

55
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:12,700
你是怎么让他们打扫的？
How did you get them to do it?

56
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,960
我是个高明的外交家
I'm a master communicator.

57
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:20,180
-你今天好吗？ -不错
- So how was your day? - Fair.

58
00:04:21,620 --> 00:04:23,700
病人没什么进展？
Nothing exciting happened with any of your patients?

59
00:04:24,380 --> 00:04:25,260
没，没，没
No, no, no.

60
00:04:27,060 --> 00:04:29,280
-今天过得好吗？ -好极了
- So how was your day? - Fantastic.

61
00:04:30,036 --> 00:04:31,700
弗瑞德把我叫到办公室.
Fred Mathis called me into his office...

62
00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:34,880
要我连载一个星期
and assigned me an entire series for next week.

63
00:04:35,275 --> 00:04:36,680
是吗？
Really?

64
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:39,320
<严肃看待污水问题>
"Let's get serious about raw sewage."

65
00:04:43,116 --> 00:04:43,940
哇!
Wow!

66
00:04:43,940 --> 00:04:45,280
真是兴奋
I'm so excited.

67
00:04:45,740 --> 00:04:47,580
你不是报道过污水的事吗？
Didn't you already do a story about waste?

68
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:51,320
人们看到污水就会想到我
Well, I guess when they think of sewage, they think of me.

69
00:04:53,140 --> 00:04:56,240
我这个周末一定会很忙
So, anyway, I'm really going to have my hands full this weekend.

70
00:04:56,840 --> 00:04:57,380
周末？
This weekend?

71
00:04:58,940 --> 00:05:00,020
-星期六？ -对
- Saturday? - Yep.

72
00:05:00,580 --> 00:05:01,520
2月8号？
February the 8th?

73
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:03,940
对，有什么安排吗？
Yes. Why? Do we have plans I don't know about?

74
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:09,420
没什么，对某个人来说很重要
No, unless it just might be a special day for someone.

75
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,820
好吧
Oh, that's right.

76
00:05:13,860 --> 00:05:15,920
我又怎会忘记呢？
How could I have forgotten?

77
00:05:17,350 --> 00:05:19,595
是总统纪念日
Presidents' Day.

78
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:22,520
甜心，今天过得好吗？
So how was your day, sweetheart?

79
00:05:30,580 --> 00:05:32,700
好吧，若是我们省着用.
All right now, Carol, if we both keep our heads...

80
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:34,620
也许够钱买汗衫做生日礼物
we can get through this birthday without losing our shirts.

81
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,840
不好意思，买什么礼物都说出来了
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to mention shirts, Carol.

82
00:05:39,572 --> 00:05:43,115
你打算花多少钱？
So how much you spending?

83
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:45,040
不知道，你打算花多少？
I don't know. How much you gonna spend?

84
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:48,200
-需要多少就多少 -不能超过10块
- As much as it takes. - Okay, but not over $10.

85
00:05:49,382 --> 00:05:53,095
10块？我一星期才2块
$10? I only get $2 a week.

86
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,960
好吧，10块差不多了
Okay, I can live with $10.

87
00:05:55,820 --> 00:05:58,120
这应该不包括贺卡吧？
Of course, with a card it might cost a little more.

88
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:03,160
-不是说好10块吗？ -凯罗
- Did I say $10? - Carol.

89
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,900
-12块 -12块半
- $12. - $12.50.
-麦克 -好吧，11块
- Mike. - All right, all right. $11.

90
00:06:08,968 --> 00:06:10,873
-15块 -凯罗
- $15. - Carol.

91
00:06:12,580 --> 00:06:13,480
好吧，25块
All right, okay. $25.

92
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:27,860
肯定不是情人节
Now, I know it's not Valentine's Day.

93
00:06:27,860 --> 00:06:29,400
那是2月14号
That's the 14th.

94
00:06:29,940 --> 00:06:31,520
算了吧
I said never mind.

95
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:36,100
杰森，给我提示
Come on, Jason, give me a hint.

96
00:06:36,329 --> 00:06:39,406
我提示就没意思了
No, if I have to do that, it ruins it.

97
00:06:41,467 --> 00:06:43,146
小宝贝
Hi, punkinhead.

98
00:06:45,340 --> 00:06:47,120
本，你来得正好
Well, Ben. You're just in time.

99
00:06:47,140 --> 00:06:50,360
提醒妈妈星期六是什么日子
Would you please remind your mother exactly what Saturday is?

100
00:06:53,279 --> 00:06:56,960
-土拔鼠节？ -算了
- Groundhog's Day? - That does it.

101
00:06:56,960 --> 00:07:00,040
我还是回办公室吧.
I'm going to my office where people not only appreciate me...

102
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:02,360
同事在我生日那天会点蜡烛
they light candles on the day I was born.

103
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:11,200
17年了，他还以为我会忘记他的生日
You'd think after 17 years, he'd know that I wouldn't forget his birthday.

104
00:07:12,580 --> 00:07:16,460
本，你们把衣服.
Wow, Ben. You folded this all by your...

105
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:19,340
谁在上面流口水了？
Who drooled all over the laundry?

106
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:24,740
-妈，有空吗？ -有啊
- You got a minute, Mom? - Sure, honey.

107
00:07:25,380 --> 00:07:28,660
我没钱给爸爸买一份好的礼物
I don't have enough money to get Dad anything good this year.

108
00:07:29,382 --> 00:07:31,800
这星期没给你双倍零用钱？
Well, didn't he double your allowance this week?

109
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:34,580
有，但这年头4块钱能买什么？
Yeah, but you can't get anything for $4, nowadays.

110
00:07:36,420 --> 00:07:37,040
你懂不懂市道？
Where you been?

111
00:07:39,580 --> 00:07:41,440
不是价钱的问题
Honey, it's not how much you spend.

112
00:07:41,740 --> 00:07:43,380
这个跟麦克，凯罗说吧
Tell that to Mike and Carol.

113
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,440
本.
Look, Ben...

114
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:50,180
我买不起他一直想要的奔驰450SL.
I can't afford to get your father that Mercedes 450SL...

115
00:07:50,180 --> 00:07:53,900
所以就送他一根钓鱼竿
he's always wanted. So I'm getting him a nice fishing rod...

116
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:59,520
他也会喜欢，因为他知道我爱他
and he knows I love him, so he'll love it.

117
00:08:00,340 --> 00:08:01,420
希望是吧
I hope.

118
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:04,120
对了!
I know!

119
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:06,480
4块钱买蚯蚓送给他
For $4, you can get him some worms.

120
00:08:07,260 --> 00:08:08,480
好主意
Get real, Mom.

121
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:14,380
我宁愿、送我做的烟灰缸
I might as well just give him the stupid ashtray I made.

122
00:08:14,380 --> 00:08:17,700
那很好，代表了你的心意
Well, that would be fine, punk, as long as it comes from your heart.

123
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:19,700
形状就是一颗心
It looks like my heart.

124
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:24,240
本，爸爸没有要你.
Ben, your father is not expecting...

125
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:27,540
-送什么贵重的礼物 -是吗？
- a big expensive gift from you. - He isn't?

126
00:08:28,241 --> 00:08:29,784
是的
No.

127
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:32,400
送什么也不要紧
He doesn't care what you get him.

128
00:08:36,182 --> 00:08:37,590
唉
Great.

129
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,460
新婚之夜.
On the wedding night...

130
00:08:41,540 --> 00:08:44,400
新人要意识到.
it is very important to recognize that the couple...

131
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:46,480
沟通的重要性
must communicate their desires...

132
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:50,120
书不打开是读不了的
and to understand that you cannot read a closed book.

133
00:08:50,260 --> 00:08:52,640
阁下多少次在火鸡面前.
How often have you sat down to carve a turkey...

134
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:55,320
因为刀子钝而束手无策？
and found yourself with a dull knife?

135
00:08:55,660 --> 00:08:59,440
-没有一次 -相信主
- Never. - Trust in the Lord...

136
00:08:59,780 --> 00:09:04,140
他会照顾你的所有需要
and all of your needs will be taken care of, for...

137
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:13,080
祈祷的力量
The power of prayer.

138
00:09:13,980 --> 00:09:17,420
需要上帝帮忙.
Be not afraid to get down on your knees...

139
00:09:17,420 --> 00:09:20,260
别怕，跪下祈祷吧
and ask God for anything.

140
00:09:20,260 --> 00:09:22,820
他会满足你的
He shall provide.

141
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:29,640
-上帝.. -你在干什么？
- Hello, God? - What are you doing?

142
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:32,080
我在为钱而祈祷
I happen to be praying for money.

143
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:36,340
祈祷是不能发财的，我试过了
Ben, you can't pray for money. Believe me, I've tried.

144
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:42,420
你真以为上帝会给你一张支票？
You actually think God's gonna send you a check or something?

145
00:09:44,450 --> 00:09:45,791
阿门
Amen.

146
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,940
-捐钱给穷人？ -谢谢
- Money for the needy? - Thanks!

147
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:10,840
-小流氓，还给我 -我就是穷人
- Give me that, you little bandit! - But I'm needy.

148
00:10:11,660 --> 00:10:14,960
我是来收钱的，不是送钱
I'm not giving money away. I'm collecting it.

149
00:10:15,340 --> 00:10:16,080
放聪明点
Wise up.

150
00:10:18,951 --> 00:10:20,920
还以为你的祈祷灵验了
For a minute there, I thought you were onto something.

151
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:23,060
我需要钱!
But I need money!

152
00:10:23,460 --> 00:10:26,400
-去赌吧 -这是生死存亡的问题
- Join the club. - But this is life or death.

153
00:10:26,780 --> 00:10:27,600
-谁的？ -我的
- Whose? - Mine.

154
00:10:27,893 --> 00:10:28,860
-我很忙 -麦克
- I'm busy. - Mike!

155
00:10:28,860 --> 00:10:31,100
好吧，本
Okay, okay. All right, look, Ben.

156
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:33,840
你拿着这个挨家逐户去讨钱
I want you to take this can and go from house to house.

157
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:36,060
瞧你的可怜样，肯定会发财
With your pathetic look, you'll probably make a fortune.

158
00:10:38,860 --> 00:10:40,060
谢谢，麦克!
Thanks, Mike!

159
00:10:41,820 --> 00:10:43,900
谢谢，上帝
And thank you, God.

160
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:57,000
谢谢，我可没上当
Thanks. You guys didn't fool me.

161
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:58,600
我就知道你们都记得
I knew all along you remembered.

162
00:10:59,325 --> 00:11:03,195
-记得什么？ -瞧这蛋糕
- Remembered what? - Look at this cake.

163
00:11:03,195 --> 00:11:05,437
-真是.. -熊熊大火
- This is... - It's a raging inferno.

164
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:08,140
-吹蜡烛! -对
- Blow out the candles! - Yeah.

165
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:10,600
-我等不了了 -好吧
- I'm burning up in here, Dad. - All right.

166
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:12,000
我许个愿、望
I know what to wish for.

167
00:11:18,380 --> 00:11:20,260
这老头还真行
Well, not bad for an old geezer.

168
00:11:21,500 --> 00:11:24,000
愿、望没实现，你还在
Well, the wish didn't work. You're still here.

169
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:26,920
爸爸，先打开好的
Here, Dad. Open the good one first.

170
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:27,640
谢谢，凯罗
Yeah, thanks, Carol.

171
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:30,580
-大家真是的 -真幼稚
- Hey, guys. - How juvenile.

172
00:11:31,220 --> 00:11:32,940
凯罗，别让他失望了
Carol, now why do you want to disappoint the man?

173
00:11:33,100 --> 00:11:34,780
这把年纪受不了打击
I mean, at his age, he can't take much of that.

174
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:37,400
这下决定了
That settles it.

175
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:41,560
-先看凯罗的礼物 -你一点也不了解.
- I'll open Carol's first. - You know, you can be so insensitive...

176
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:44,180
长者们的感情
about the problems of older people.

177
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,540
本，你的礼物呢？
Ben, what did you get me?

178
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:52,520
-最好的应该最后拆 -随便拆一份吧
- The best should be last. - Well, will you just open something?

179
00:11:54,580 --> 00:11:56,460
越长越优先
And the longest shall be first.

180
00:11:57,560 --> 00:12:00,500
好吧，你们先等我打开妈妈的礼物
All right, you guys can all wait while I open something from your mom.

181
00:12:00,853 --> 00:12:02,526
谢谢你
Thank you, dear.

182
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:05,040
我改变主意了，下个轮到你
No, I changed my mind, Carol. You go next.

183
00:12:05,140 --> 00:12:07,060
不行，到你
No way. You go next.

184
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,540
既然你坚持.
If you insist.

185
00:12:14,500 --> 00:12:16,080
瞧瞧
Yes, look at that.

186
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:19,140
-喜欢吗？ -很喜欢
- Do you like it? - Honey, I love it.

187
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:22,341
-可以退货 -不
- I can take it back. - No.

188
00:12:22,341 --> 00:12:26,883
这好极了 钓到每一条鱼我都会想起你
No, this is perfect. Every time I kill a fish, I'll think of you.

189
00:12:28,147 --> 00:12:30,254
杰森，你太好了
Jason, that's so sweet.

190
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,280
爸爸，凯罗让你接着拆她的礼物
Here, Dad, Carol wants you to open my gift, next.

191
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:35,400
拆吧，你会开怀大笑的
Go ahead, Dad. You could use a good laugh.

192
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,620
是鞋子？
It's shoes, isn't it?

193
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:42,020
-太好笑了 -谢谢本
- That's funny, Dad. - Thank you, Ben.

194
00:12:46,860 --> 00:12:49,920
瞧!“六零年代巨星”
Look at this! "Superstars of the '60s."

195
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:55,620
“重温60年代的精神兴欢乐”
"Relive the triumphs, the joy, the spirit of the '60s."

196
00:12:55,674 --> 00:12:59,113
里面所有歌手都因为吸毒死了
Yes. See, everybody on this album died of a drug overdose.

197
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:02,455
妙极了
Groovy.

198
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:05,700
-说明他很欣赏 -这是什么？
- "Groovy." That means he likes it. - Okay, what's this?

199
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,580
希望你喜欢.
I wanted to get you something...

200
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:10,140
这对你和作为心理医师都有作用
that you could enjoy both as a person and as a psychiatrist.

201
00:13:10,780 --> 00:13:14,620
谢谢，我两个身份都会喜欢的
Well, thank you. I'm sure that both of me will love it.

202
00:13:14,620 --> 00:13:16,200
这是.
And it is...

203
00:13:18,220 --> 00:13:20,840
两张百老汇歌剧的门票
two tickets to the off-Broadway production of Nuts.

204
00:13:21,381 --> 00:13:22,628
太好了
That's so great.

205
00:13:23,140 --> 00:13:24,640
轮到我了
Okay, my turn.

206
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:27,600
对，看看你给我什么
Ben. Yeah, let's see what you got me.

207
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:28,240
请看!
Ta-da!

208
00:13:28,900 --> 00:13:30,320
你自己包装的？
Wow, you wrap this yourself?

209
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:31,240
店里包装的
I had it done.

210
00:13:32,359 --> 00:13:35,643
真可爱，把钱都花在包装上了
How sweet. He spent all his money on wrapping.

211
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:38,160
看看里面是什么
Let's see what we got in here, Ben.

212
00:13:43,700 --> 00:13:45,680
哇，本.
Wow, Ben...

213
00:13:45,940 --> 00:13:47,380
太棒了
this is fabulous.

214
00:13:48,408 --> 00:13:51,794
-我真说不出话了 -我也是
- Maggie, I don't know what to say. - Neither do I.

215
00:13:53,420 --> 00:13:57,600
-这礼物兴我无关 -当然了，兴你无关
- I had nothing to do with this. - Oh, sure, you had nothing to do with it.

216
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,240
真的
Jason, I didn't.

217
00:14:02,022 --> 00:14:03,974
本.
Ben...

218
00:14:04,760 --> 00:14:06,720
这是全自动相机
It does everything all by itself.

219
00:14:06,780 --> 00:14:08,380
白痴也能用
Even an idiot could work it.

220
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:13,460
-这是哪来的？ -牛斯顿照相馆
- Ben, where'd you get this? - At Newstrom's Camera Store.

221
00:14:13,820 --> 00:14:16,040
满300块送皮套一个
They throw in a leather case every time you spend over $300.

222
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,840
我倒想问问.
All right, I gotta ask.

223
00:14:18,860 --> 00:14:21,240
你们给他的零用钱究竟有多少？
What kind of allowance are you giving this kid, anyway?

224
00:14:24,244 --> 00:14:27,629
-本，钱哪来的？ -洗耳恭听
- Ben, where did you get the money? - Yeah, I'm interested.

225
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:30,700
我需要钱
Well, see, I needed money.

226
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:34,520
所以我到邻居那里募捐
So I went around to all our neighbors' houses and asked for money for the needy.

227
00:14:41,220 --> 00:14:44,440
本.西弗，这主意是怎么想出来的？
Benjamin Seaver, where did you ever get an idea like that?

228
00:14:45,460 --> 00:14:49,080
上帝和麦克告诉我的
From God and Mike.

229
00:14:51,104 --> 00:14:52,384
-麦克! -麦克!
- Mike! - Mike!

230
00:14:57,120 --> 00:15:00,540
爸，很明显这里面有误会
So as you can see, Dad, what we have here is just a simple little mix-up.

231
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,420
本太小了，不知道我在开玩笑
Now, young Ben didn't realize that I was only joking...

232
00:15:03,420 --> 00:15:06,180
这事你肯定能理解
but I'm sure that you can see how that could happen...

233
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:09,460
因为你是个职业精神病医师
particularly since you are a trained psychiatrist...

234
00:15:09,900 --> 00:15:11,800
补充一句，非常优秀的医师
and, may I add, a damn good one.

235
00:15:13,700 --> 00:15:16,200
睁眼说瞎话也能做到？
How do you do that with a straight face?

236
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:18,860
这是天赋
It's a gift.

237
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:22,800
这也许能骗爸爸.
Okay, that junk may work on Dad...

238
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:25,820
但妈妈可是污水废物的专家
but Mom knows raw sewage when she sees it.

239
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:31,240
凯罗，我是她的大儿子，当然疼爱有加
Carol, I am her firstborn. You might say the woman is putty in my hands.

240
00:15:33,132 --> 00:15:34,121
Oh?

241
00:15:35,540 --> 00:15:38,500
你怎么能说这种话!
But don't say that to me, because that woman...

242
00:15:38,500 --> 00:15:40,640
她是我母亲，我敬爱她!
is my mother and I respect her.

243
00:15:42,980 --> 00:15:45,440
本，你把我搞糊涂了
I'm confused, Ben. I don't get it.

244
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:48,880
你怎么能挨门逐户撒谎.
I do not understand how you can go door to door, lie to people...

245
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:51,080
骗取人们的善款.
take their money in the name of charity...

246
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:53,960
一点也不知悔改
and not have it occur to you that what you were doing was wrong.

247
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:56,520
可效果比想象中要好
It did seem too good to be true.

248
00:15:57,380 --> 00:15:59,340
怎能干这种蠢事？
How could you act so stupidly?

249
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:02,740
差点忘了，是麦克的主意
I forgot. You got the idea from Mike.

250
00:16:04,660 --> 00:16:06,940
这相机可是自动卷片的
Did I mention that the camera is self-winding?

251
00:16:07,260 --> 00:16:09,340
-本 -还能自动对焦
- Ben. - And automatic focus?

252
00:16:10,417 --> 00:16:12,229
是吗？
Really?

253
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:15,320
我一直想送你一份真正的礼物
Well, for once I wanted to get you a real gift.

254
00:16:16,620 --> 00:16:18,960
我感谢你的好意
Well, I know that and I appreciate it...

255
00:16:19,326 --> 00:16:21,640
但你对别人的爱.
and I thank you for the thought, but you don't show somebody...

256
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:24,480
并不是用金钱来衡量的
how much you love them by how much you spend on them...

257
00:16:25,060 --> 00:16:26,720
除非你老婆是电视明星
unless you're married to Pia Zadora.

258
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:30,460
-什么？ -没什么
- Huh? - Nothing.

259
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,620
这事该怎么办？
So what do we do about this?

260
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:35,040
你问我？
You're asking me?

261
00:16:36,180 --> 00:16:38,360
我要你自己想出惩罚的办法.
I think that I'd like to see if you can come up with your own punishment...

262
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:40,840
好让你明白做错了什么
just to make sure you realize how serious this is.

263
00:16:42,020 --> 00:16:45,080
我？自由选择？
Me? I get to pick whatever I want?

264
00:16:46,800 --> 00:16:48,440
我做最后决定
I get to vote on it.

265
00:16:49,740 --> 00:16:53,340
某些孩子也许会认为这是受罪.
Well, some kids would say that they've suffered enough...

266
00:16:55,760 --> 00:16:57,120
但我不会
but not me.

267
00:16:57,760 --> 00:17:01,520
我这星期会每天9点上床睡觉
I say that every night this week, I should be sent to bed at...

268
00:17:01,553 --> 00:17:02,815
9:00.

269
00:17:03,340 --> 00:17:04,920
本，你本来就是9点睡的
That is your bedtime, Ben.

270
00:17:06,100 --> 00:17:07,300
是啊
Oh, yeah.

271
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:11,800
要么罚我25岁才能拿驾照
Okay, then, I don't get my driver's license until I'm 25.

272
00:17:14,100 --> 00:17:16,160
-算了，惩罚还是我决定吧 -26岁？
- Forget it. I'll decide your punishment. - 26?

273
00:17:18,740 --> 00:17:21,780
难道你就压根儿没想到.
And it never occurred to you, not even for a second...

274
00:17:21,780 --> 00:17:23,300
本会把你的话当真吗？
that Ben might take you seriously?

275
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:25,920
谁会把我的话当真啊？
No. Nobody takes me seriously.

276
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:29,660
这话有道理
He does have a point.

277
00:17:30,330 --> 00:17:33,415
-回房间去 -为什么？
- Carol, go to your room. - Why, Mom?

278
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:35,680
因为这是命令
Because I said so, young lady.

279
00:17:36,940 --> 00:17:39,020
那就失陪了
Well, excuse me, then.

280
00:17:40,980 --> 00:17:42,500
妈，干得好
Good move, Mom.

281
00:17:42,900 --> 00:17:43,780
是吗？
Can it, Mike.

282
00:17:44,900 --> 00:17:47,080
本把你这位大哥哥.
Now don't you know that Ben looks up to you...

283
00:17:47,140 --> 00:17:48,640
当作榜样看待
his big brother, as an example?

284
00:17:49,380 --> 00:17:50,240
胡说
Get out of here.

285
00:17:50,580 --> 00:17:52,520
我也以为不可能
Look, I don't like it any more than you do...

286
00:17:53,600 --> 00:17:56,380
但你没看到他在学你说话.
but don't you see the way he tries to talk like you...

287
00:17:56,380 --> 00:17:58,840
学你走路，跳舞，任何事情吗？
walk like you, dance like you, do everything like you?

288
00:18:01,228 --> 00:18:04,175
天哪!要让他改邪归正
Oh, my God! Somebody should set this kid straight.

289
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:07,040
太晚了，他崇拜你
Too late. He worships you.

290
00:18:07,968 --> 00:18:10,551
告诉他我是社会渣滓
Can't we tell him I'm scum or something?

291
00:18:10,740 --> 00:18:12,600
说了他会更热衷
I did. It only made him more interested.

292
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:17,480
-这个负担我可受不了 -麦克，责无旁贷
- I'm not sure I can live with this burden. - Well, you're stuck with it, Michael...

293
00:18:17,580 --> 00:18:20,460
为了让你记住这点，下个月的零用钱.
and just so you don't forget it, you'll be donating your allowance...

294
00:18:20,460 --> 00:18:22,320
你要捐出来
for the next month to charity.

295
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:25,860
妈，我做了天大的错事吗？
But, Mom, you're acting like I did something really wrong here.

296
00:18:28,020 --> 00:18:29,280
确实是
I did, didn't I?

297
00:18:31,540 --> 00:18:34,000
好了，本已经承认了错误
Okay, I think Ben understands what he did...

298
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:36,400
-惩罚我们也决定好了 -我们？
- and we've decided on his punishment. - We?

299
00:18:37,100 --> 00:18:39,260
-首先是退回相机 -好的
- First, we'll be returning the camera. - Good.

300
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:41,900
-然后退掉所有钱 -好的
- Then we will give back all the money. - Good.

301
00:18:42,060 --> 00:18:44,820
挨家逐户地去还 让本告诉大家他撒谎了
By going house to house, so that Ben can tell everyone he lied.

302
00:18:45,380 --> 00:18:47,280
-杰森 -穿大衣
- Jason. - Okay, get your coat.

303
00:18:47,374 --> 00:18:49,627
-现在去？ -当然了
- You're doing this now? - Absolutely.

304
00:18:49,660 --> 00:18:51,500
-天都黑了 -又怎样？
- But it's almost dark. - So?

305
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:54,760
我知道他应当受罚
Jason, I know he needs to be punished...

306
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:57,140
解释的事我去就好
but what if I explain it to the neighbors?

307
00:18:57,720 --> 00:19:01,180
不，他需要吸取教训
No, I think that he's got to understand his own responsibility here.

308
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:03,300
他还是个小孩子
But, Jason, he's our baby.

309
00:19:03,824 --> 00:19:06,480
-小傻瓜 -9岁半
- A little tyke. - Nine-and-a-half.

310
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:07,520
我能懂什么？
What do I know?

311
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:11,560
麦姬，咱的“小傻瓜”.
Maggie, our "little tyke"...

312
00:19:11,560 --> 00:19:14,000
犯的是严重罪行
has committed a felony.

313
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:19,520
本，别忘了戴手套
Don't forget your mittens, Ben.

314
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:30,420
“灰尘不能扫到地毯下面就完了”
"Raw sewage cannot simply be swept under the rug."

315
00:19:32,020 --> 00:19:35,000
-不 -妈？
- No. - Mom?

316
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:36,560
凯罗？
Yes, Carol?

317
00:19:36,923 --> 00:19:38,640
9点了
It's 9:00.

318
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:40,840
知道了，我也在担心他们
I know, honey. I'm worried about them, too.

319
00:19:41,120 --> 00:19:43,680
我可以出房间了吗？
Can I come out of my room now?

320
00:19:45,465 --> 00:19:50,015
当然了宝贝，快下来
Oh, my God. Sure, honey. Come on down.

321
00:19:54,320 --> 00:19:56,720
对不起，把你关在房间里了
Sweetheart, I'm sorry I sent you to your room.

322
00:19:56,760 --> 00:19:58,660
这太不公道了
That was very unfair of me.

323
00:19:59,660 --> 00:20:00,860
确实是
Yes, it was.

324
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:05,860
告诉你一个小秘密
Well, let me tell you a little secret...

325
00:20:05,980 --> 00:20:08,240
从来没告诉过你们的
and this is something I've never told you kids before.

326
00:20:08,955 --> 00:20:10,432
什么？
Yeah?

327
00:20:12,220 --> 00:20:14,660
我..还是这样说吧
I'm... Well, I should just say it.

328
00:20:15,420 --> 00:20:16,700
我并不完美
I'm not perfect.

329
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:21,000
秘密是什么？
Yeah, so what's the secret?

330
00:20:24,500 --> 00:20:25,540
妈妈
Mom. Mom.

331
00:20:25,560 --> 00:20:28,820
我给你准备了伯爵柠檬茶
I've prepared a lovely cup of Earl Grey tea for you with lemon...

332
00:20:28,820 --> 00:20:30,760
还有一块热了的松饼
and an English muffin, lightly toasted.

333
00:20:31,100 --> 00:20:34,740
谢谢你，真是无微不至
Why, thank you, Michael. That was very thoughtful of you.

334
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:37,820
不过下个月的零用钱还是要捐
Oh, and by the way, it is still a month's allowance...

335
00:20:40,120 --> 00:20:41,420
我很欣赏你的做法
but I like your style.

336
00:20:45,100 --> 00:20:46,660
杰森
- Jason. - Shh!

337
00:20:48,228 --> 00:20:49,908
他睡了？
Is he asleep?

338
00:20:53,040 --> 00:20:55,340
松饼上还加了奶酪
Did I mention that there was cheese on that muffin?

339
00:20:59,980 --> 00:21:01,420
钱还给你
Here's your money back.

340
00:21:02,100 --> 00:21:04,240
对不起我骗你是募捐
I'm sorry I lied about the charity.

341
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:07,340
好了，儿子，咱回家了
- It's okay, Son. We're home now. - Oh.

342
00:21:09,260 --> 00:21:12,260
-你今晚真让我自豪 -谢谢
- I'm proud of what you did tonight. - Thanks.

343
00:21:13,700 --> 00:21:14,760
得到教训了吗？
Think you learned a lesson?

344
00:21:16,560 --> 00:21:20,140
上帝再给我主意的话，先跟你商量
When God gives me an idea, to check with you first.

345
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:24,700
还有呢？
Anything else?

346
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:28,580
爱某个人不必花很多的钱
If you love somebody, you don't have to spend a lot on 'em.

347
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:31,080
说得对
That's right.

348
00:21:33,580 --> 00:21:37,160
-晚安 -晚安
- Good night, punk. - Good night.

349
00:21:41,780 --> 00:21:43,600
-爸爸？ -什么事？
- Dad? - Yeah?

350
00:21:52,100 --> 00:21:53,320
生日快乐
Happy birthday.

351
00:21:57,880 --> 00:21:58,810
本，这.
Ben, it's...

352
00:21:59,120 --> 00:21:59,940
烟灰缸
An ashtray.

353
00:22:01,060 --> 00:22:02,620
我知道
Yeah, I know.

354
00:22:03,169 --> 00:22:05,180
我要说的是.
What I was going to say was...

355
00:22:05,180 --> 00:22:07,980
这是今年最好的生日礼物
it's the best birthday present I've gotten all year.

356
00:22:09,300 --> 00:22:11,000
但你不抽烟
But you don't even smoke.

357
00:22:11,120 --> 00:22:12,560
我有些病人抽
No, but some of my patients do.

358
00:22:12,600 --> 00:22:13,480
有些想戒掉
Some of them want to quit.

359
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:16,400
这烟灰缸能帮他们戒烟
I think your ashtray just might do the trick.

360
00:22:26,900 --> 00:22:29,140
这真是个烟灰缸!
Is this an ashtray, or what?

361
00:22:30,120 --> 00:22:32,200
烟蒂可以塞到主动脉里
Look, you stick your butt right in the aorta.

